return {h=10,w=1150,cr=120,hc=20,bh=70,gr="slow",eg={"monster","ground"},st={80,85,95,30,30,25},ab={{31,0},{69,0},{120,1}},genus={en="Spikes Pokémon",es="Pokémon Clavos",pt="Pokémon Espinhos"},flavor={en={[1]="Its massive bones are 1000 times harder than human bones. It can easily knock a trailer flying.",[2]="Its massive bones are 1000 times harder than human bones. It can easily knock a trailer flying.",[3]="A Pokémon with a one-track mind. Once it charges, it won't stop running until it falls asleep.",[4]="It is inept at turning because of its four short legs. It can only charge and run in one direction.",[5]="It doesn't care if there is anything in its way. It just charges and destroys all obstacles.",[6]="It can remember only one thing at a time. Once it starts rushing, it forgets why it started.",[7]="RHYHORN runs in a straight line, smashing everything in its path. It is not bothered even if it rushes headlong into a block of steel. This Pokémon may feel some pain from the collision the next day, however.",[8]="RHYHORN’s brain is very small. It is so dense, while on a run it forgets why it started running in the first place. It apparently remembers sometimes if it demolishes something.",[9]="Once it starts running, it doesn’t stop. Its tiny brain makes it so stupid that it can’t remember why it started running in the first place.",[10]="Strong, but not too bright, this Pokémon can shatter even a skyscraper with its charging TACKLES.",[11]="Its massive bones are 1,000 times harder than human bones. Its TACKLE can knock a semitrailer flying.",[12]="Its body is clad in a thick hide, and its tackles topple buildings. Unfortunately, it is not smart.",[13]="Its body is clad in a thick hide, and its tackles topple buildings. Unfortunately, it is not smart.",[14]="Its powerful tackles can destroy anything. However, it is too slow witted to help people work.",[15]="It is inept at turning because of its four short legs. It can only charge and run in one direction.",[16